Article 2 (Securities Excluded from the Objects of Security Rights over Movable Property) The term "securities prescribed by Presidential Decree, including bearer bond certificates" in Article 3 (3) 3 of the Act on Security over Movable Property, Claims, etc. (hereinafter referred to as the "Act") means the following:
1. Bearer bond certificates;
2. Asset-backed securities under subparagraph 4 of Article 2 of the Asset-Backed Securitization Act;
3. Securities under Article 4 of the Financial Investment Services and Capital Markets Act.
